    "https://www.nwciowa.edu/deposit": {
      "title": "Deposit",
      "description": "Deposit | Northwestern College in Iowa Skip to main menu Skip to main content Skip to footer Academics Undergraduate Information for students seeking a bachelor’s degree on campus. Graduate + Online Information about graduate degrees and online programs for adults. Admissions Undergraduate Information for students seeking a bachelor’s degree on campus. Graduate + Online Information about graduate degrees and online programs for adults. About Athletics Search Open main menu Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate + Online Programs Admissions + Aid Admissions Apply Visit Graduate + Online Transfer to NWC Tuition + Fees Scholarships Financial Aid Why NWC? Life at Northwestern Campus Life Faith Residence Life About Northwestern Red Raider Athletics Alumni Give to NWC Resources Academic Calendars Bookstore Catalog Compass Center Directory Employment Events Calendar Library Maps + Directions News Español MyNWC Contact Us Deposit Deposit Deposit Congratulations on your acceptance to Northwestern College! Your next step toward enrollment is submitting your $200 deposit. (This amount is different for international students .) Course registration and residence hall preferences are prioritized by the date we receive your deposit, so do this as soon as possible. (You’ll receive information about applying for housing in January and information about registering for courses in March.) If you change your mind, your deposit is fully refundable through May 1. Contact your admissions counselor with any questions. Congratulations on your acceptance to Northwestern College! Your next step toward enrollment is submitting your $200 deposit. (This amount is different for international students .) Course registration and residence hall preferences are prioritized by the date we receive your deposit, so do this as soon as possible. (You’ll receive information about applying for housing in January and information about registering for courses in March.) If you change your mind, your deposit is fully refundable through May 1. Contact your admissions counselor with any questions. Congratulations on your acceptance to Northwestern College! Your next step toward enrollment is submitting your $200 deposit. (This amount is different for international students .) Course registration and residence hall preferences are prioritized by the date we receive your deposit, so do this as soon as possible. (You’ll receive information about applying for housing in January and information about registering for courses in March.) If you change your mind, your deposit is fully refundable through May 1. Contact your admissions counselor with any questions. SUBMIT MY DEPOSIT SUBMIT MY DEPOSIT SUBMIT MY DEPOSIT To submit your deposit, log in using the username and password you created when you applied to Northwestern College. Follow the prompts provided in your account to secure your spot in Raider Nation! To submit your deposit, log in using the username and password you created when you applied to Northwestern College. Follow the prompts provided in your account to secure your spot in Raider Nation! To submit your deposit, log in using the username and password you created when you applied to Northwestern College. Follow the prompts provided in your account to secure your spot in Raider Nation! Quick Links Directory Giving Jobs Campus Map Alumni Bookstore Community + Belonging Admissions Apply Visit Inquire Graduate + Online Resources Español MyNWC Academic Calendar Blackboard Catalog Email Library © 2026 Northwestern College 101 7th Street SW Orange City, IA 51041 712-707-7000 Contact Us About Calendar News Privacy Policy Student Consumer Information"
